        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Season Subscription—Light | musica intima"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "$40 - musica intima believes in access to the arts for all, especially during the COVID-19 pandemic. Enjoy the three-concert season digitally with links to watch \"the spirit’s dwelling\", \"ceremony of carols”, and “the beginning of the song”, as well as the audience favourite—\"ding dong!\""
      }
    ],
