      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ḵi’mola means ‘walking together’ in the Kwakwala language, and is brand new curation by Marion Newman, the exceptional mezzo-soprano of Kwagiulth and Stó:lō First Nations with English, Irish and Scottish heritage."
